<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: Gene-seed Material: Dark Angels -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.label>基因种子材料：黑暗天使</BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.label>
  <!-- EN: Your gene-seed comes from Lion El'Jonson and is relatively pure, allowing for more successful and less deadly implantation. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.description>你的基因种子来自莱昂·庄森，其纯度相对较高，可以提高植入的成功率，并降低其致死率。</BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.description>
  <!-- EN: 15% decrease to gene-seed implantation failure chance. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.customEffectDescriptions.0>基因种子植入失败率降低15%</BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: 15% decrease to gene-seed implantation failure chance cap. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.customEffectDescriptions.1>基因种子植入失败率上限降低15%</BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.customEffectDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: Increased chance for rubicon surgery survival. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.customEffectDescriptions.2>增加转化手术存活率。</BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.customEffectDescriptions.2>
  <!-- EN: Dark Angels -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.modExtensions.0.chapterName>黑暗天使</BEWH_ChapterIDarkAngels.modExtensions.0.chapterName>
  
  <!-- EN: Gene-seed Material: Emperor's Children -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.label>基因种子材料：帝皇之子</BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.label>
  <!-- EN: Your gene-seed comes from Fulgrim. Like him, you take pleasure in the finer arts of the world, but prefer not to share them with others. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.description>你的基因种子来自福格瑞姆。和他一样，你也很喜欢欣赏世间的精致艺术，但不愿与他人分享。</BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.description>
  <!-- EN: Emperor's Children -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.modExtensions.0.chapterName>帝皇之子</BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.modExtensions.0.chapterName>
  
  <!-- UNUSED -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.customEffectDescriptions.0>增加观赏艺术获得的娱乐值。</BEWH_ChapterIIIEmperorsChildren.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  
  <!-- EN: Gene-seed Material: Iron Warriors -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.label>基因种子材料：钢铁勇士</BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.label>
  <!-- EN: Your gene-seed comes from Perturabo and is somewhat pure. You are able to quickly set up siege armaments and fortifications. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.description>你的基因种子来自佩图拉博，并且较为纯净。受其影响，你可以迅速设置攻城器械和构筑防御工事。</BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.description>
  <!-- EN: Chance to have either Psychopath or Transhumanist trait. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.customEffectDescriptions.0>有几率获得“心理变态”或“超人主义”特性。</BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: 7% decrease to gene-seed implantation failure chance. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.customEffectDescriptions.1>基因种子植入失败率降低7%</BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.customEffectDescriptions.1>
  <!-- EN: 7% decrease to gene-seed implantation failure chance cap. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.customEffectDescriptions.2>基因种子植入失败率上限降低7%</BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.customEffectDescriptions.2>
  <!-- EN: Iron Warriors -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.modExtensions.0.chapterName>钢铁勇士</BEWH_ChapterIVIronWarriors.modExtensions.0.chapterName>
  
  <!-- EN: Gene-seed Material: Blood Angels -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.label>基因种子材料：圣血天使</BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.label>
  <!-- EN: Your gene-seed comes from Sanguinius. You carry his righteous wrath against those who threaten your people. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.description>你的基因种子来自圣吉列斯。你将带着他的圣血之怒，粉碎一切与你族众为敌的人。</BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.description>
  <!-- EN: Gives the Red Thirst gene. -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.customEffectDescriptions.0>添加“血渴”基因。</BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.customEffectDescriptions.0>
  <!-- EN: Blood Angels -->
  <BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.modExtensions.0.chapterName>圣血天使</BEWH_ChapterIXBloodAngels.modExtensions.0.chapterName>
  
